  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  12 of 12 stay profitable in at least 95% of draws.

  This is a bound, not a measurement. A strategy that survives it has an edge that
  does not depend on the missing companies; one that does not is indistinguishable
  from an artifact of their absence, and this data cannot tell the two apart.

